; noaa_bb.incl -- NOAA biomass burning: furans, furfurals, phenolics: the F0AM extension of the MCM v3.3.1 (Chem/MCMv331/NOAA_BiomassBurning) as an add-on,
;   built by f0am_import.py 2026-11-10 from the difference to F0AM's own MCM v3.3.1.
; Decker et al. (2019), ES&T; Coggon et al. (MCMUpdates_BiomassBurning_DeckerCoggon.pptx); F0AM version G. M. Wolfe.  F0AM: github.com/AirChem/F0AM, GPL-3.0.
; source files sha256[:16]: MCMv331_AllRxns.fac 338e96ad0d86506e, MCMv331_AllRxns_NOAABB.fac 9e3d1feca1b8984f, MCMv331_AllRxns_NOAABB.m 471a4c0865cafb5e
; 78 new reactions, 2 re-rated MCM reactions, 47 new species (12 in RO2).
; corrections of the later F0AM .m applied: J<59> -> JN2; J<58> -> JN52; C3H4 -> FURFC3H4 (from FURFURAL)
; CISOPCO2 = CISOPCO: the extension's rate 2.00D-12*0.8*RO2 is already JUICE's MCM v3.3.1 rate (F0AM's MCM copy has 2.40D-12*0.8*RO2); no override
; CISOPCO2 = HC4CCHO: the extension's rate 2.00D-12*0.1*RO2 is already JUICE's MCM v3.3.1 rate (F0AM's MCM copy has 2.40D-12*0.1*RO2); no override
; CISOPCO2 = ISOPAOH: the extension's rate 2.00D-12*0.1*RO2 is already JUICE's MCM v3.3.1 rate (F0AM's MCM copy has 2.40D-12*0.1*RO2); no override

; F0AM photolysis channels without an MCM number (sun: clear-sky fit, photolysis/f0am_jn_clear_sky.csv;
;   a lamp chamber redefines them after this file)
JN2 = PHTFKT(1.4311e-06,0.3512,-0.036)   ; C6H5C(O)H-> C6H5+HC(O)
JN52 = PHTFKT(3.5196e-04,0.3766,-0.0347)   ; FURFURAL -> products (QY 0.5, NOAA lab, Coggon p.comm. 2019)

; ---- reactions ----
FURAN + OH  -->  MALDIAL + HO2
FURAN + OH  -->  HYDFURANO2
HYDFURANO2 + NO  -->  MALDALCO2H + NO2 + HO2
HYDFURANO2 + HO2  -->  HYDFURANOOH
HYDFURANOOH + hv  -->  MALDALCO2H + OH
HYDFURANOOH + OH  -->  MALDALCO2H + OH
HYDFURANO2  -->  MALDALCO2H + HO2
