HYDDIMEFURANO2  -->  C5CO14OH + CH3O2
HYDDIMEFURANOOH + hv  -->  C5CO14OH + OH + CH3O2
FURFURAL + OH  -->  FURFURALO2
FURFURAL + OH  -->  C5DIALCO + HO2
FURFURAL + OH  -->  HYDFURFURALO2
FURFURAL + OH  -->  ALDFURFURALO2 + HO2
