k[HYDDIMEFURANO2-->C5CO14OH+CH3O2]=CONST(1D-14*RO2)
k[HYDDIMEFURANOOH+hv-->C5CO14OH+OH+CH3O2]=CONST(J41)
k[FURFURAL+OH-->FURFURALO2]=CONST(3.50D-11*0.01)
k[FURFURAL+OH-->C5DIALCO+HO2]=CONST(3.50D-11*0.4351)
k[FURFURAL+OH-->HYDFURFURALO2]=CONST(3.50D-11*0.5269)
k[FURFURAL+OH-->ALDFURFURALO2+HO2]=CONST(3.50D-11*0.028)
k[FURFURALO2+NO-->MALDALCO2H+NO2+CO+HO2]=CONST(KRO2NO)
